      "EpisodeDurationInSeconds": 3166,
      "Title": "Ghost Workers",
      "OrginalTitle": "Ghost workers",
      "Description": "A meal delivered with a click, friends on the screen, robots at the service of humans: Google, Facebook, Uber... have revolutionised our lives. However, this wonderful world of technology hides a less glamorous reality.\r\nTo make their applications work, the giants of the economy hire an army of small invisible hands. Disposable workers, poorly paid, without work contracts or social security.\r\nA survey on the working conditions of internet cleaners, called content managers. .",
